From a6a3c5275c36ec215049ef1fa41ba8fbe81402da Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Olivier Moysan <olivier.moysan@foss.st.com>
Date: Tue, 26 May 2026 15:41:55 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: mailbox: add power-domains property to
 stm32-ipcc

Allow power-domains on stm32-ipcc mailbox nodes.

This fixes dtbs_check error:
mailbox@4c001000 (st,stm32mp1-ipcc): 'power-domains' does not match any
of the regexes: '^pinctrl-[0-9]+$'

Change-Id: I121f0b15cccc4490092f8856f5bc1b7477c3d004
Signed-off-by: Olivier Moysan <olivier.moysan@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/linux-stm32/+/571637
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Arnaud POULIQUEN <arnaud.pouliquen@st.com>
Domain-Review: Arnaud POULIQUEN <arnaud.pouliquen@st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/st,stm32-ipcc.yaml | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/st,stm32-ipcc.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/st,stm32-ipcc.yaml
@@ -26,6 +26,9 @@ properties:
   clocks:
     maxItems: 1
 
+  power-domains:
+    maxItems: 1
+
   interrupts:
     items:
       - description: rx channel occupied
